          "text": "AI loses its mind when angry.\n\nA 2026 study reveals that when induced with anger through simulated scenarios, LLM agents develop bias during sequential decision making.\n\nAnger reduces the AI's sensitivity to penalties and halts its exploration of new options. Consequently, the model gets trapped in early risky choices instead of finding optimal solutions. \n\nDespite lacking biological emotions, AI can still have its judgment compromised when processing negative user contexts."
